'''''Asphodelus lusitanicus''''' is a species of [[Asphodelus|asphodel]], endemic to the [[Iberian Peninsula]].<ref name="531512-1">{{cite POWO |id=531512-1 |title=''Asphodelus lusitanicus'' Cout. |access-date=6 September 2022 }}</ref>

==Taxonomy==
Two varieties are recognised:<ref name="iberica">{{cite web |url=http://www.floraiberica.es/floraiberica/texto/pdfs/20_183_31_Asphodelus.pdf |title=''Asphodelus'' L. |publisher=[[Flora Iberica]] |access-date=September 6, 2022}}</ref>
*''Asphodelus lusitanicus'' var. ''lusitanicus''.
*''Asphodelus lusitanicus'' var. ''ovoideus'' (Merino) Z.Díaz & Valdés.

